  "Description": {
    "Cost": 2892127,
    "UIName": "Thunderbolt",
    "Id": "chassisdef_thunderbolt_TDR-QS1",
    "Name": "Thunderbolt",
    "Details": "Quicsell's Heavy Ballistic Sniper. The TDR-QS1 is capable of sending twelve AC2 rounds downrange in a single volley. With fire like that, aiming is optional! While some have critisized our DAC2 model specifically for its vulnerability to misfires, we here at Quicsell responded by giving you six of them. After all, it's not like they'll all break.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.07</color></b>",
